 &lt;BR&gt; 
2.	The unaudited financial results of the Company have been prepared in accordance with Indian Accounting Standards (‘Ind AS’) prescribed under Section 133 of the Companies Act, 2013 read with the relevant rules issued thereunder and in terms of the Regulation 33 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015, as amended. &lt;BR&gt; 
 &lt;BR&gt; 
